  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 900,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Sustained load: Vertex us-central1, concurrency 64",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**47,677 requests over 20.8 minutes at 36.9 rps sustained**, ~2,217 requests/minute. Vertex rate-limited **18 (0.038%)**, all recovered by retry. Connection pool peaked at 25% and event loop lag under 5 ms, so the ceiling is **server-side**. p99 oscillates between 3.7 s and 9.6 s with no systematic trend \u2014 an apparent +37% rise in an earlier 8.7-minute run did not replicate here and is retracted. Driven by `harness/run.py` directly, so only `llm_*` metrics populate."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spent",
